            "repere": "Intertitre · 4. Get Close Without Beating Up Your S…",
            "text": "4. Get Close Without Beating Up Your Scalp",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s166",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Chasing the closest possible shave can…",
            "text": "Chasing the closest possible shave can mean razor burn, bumps, nicks, or going over the same spots again and again. Freebird gives you a <span style=\"font-weight:700\">close everyday shave without an exposed razor blade against your scalp</span>, plus wet or dry options so you can find the routine that works best for you.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "i169",
