            "image": "/imports/freebird-offre/images/09.png",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s171",
            "repere": "Intertitre · 5. Don’t Settle for a Head Shaver That…",
            "text": "5. Don’t Settle for a Head Shaver That Looks Good but Makes You Work for the Result",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s174",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Plenty of electric head shavers promis…",
            "text": "Plenty of electric head shavers promise fast, smooth results - then leave you going over the same spots again and again. Freebird is built around <span style=\"font-weight:700\">getting your whole head clean and evenly shaved</span>, with flexible scalp coverage, a complete trim-and-shave system, replacement blades, support, and warranty protection.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
