          {
            "slot": "s183",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · The only way to know if a head shaver …",
            "text": "The only way to know if a head shaver works for you is to actually use it on your hair, your scalp, and your normal amount of growth. Freebird lets you <span style=\"font-weight:700\">try the routine for yourself without feeling locked in</span>, with clear guarantee and refill terms.",
