            "slot": "s657",
            "repere": "Grand titre · QUESTIONS?",
            "text": "QUESTIONS?",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s658",
            "repere": "Grand titre · LET US HELP YOU",
            "text": "LET US HELP YOU",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s663",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · How close does the Freebird FlexSeries…",
            "text": "How close does the Freebird FlexSeries® shave compared to a razor?",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s668",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Freebird is designed to cut short hair…",
            "text": "Freebird is designed to cut short hair close to the scalp for a smooth, clean-shaven bald look without obvious patches or uneven shadow. A fresh razor may still feel slightly smoother against the grain, but Freebird gives you a close everyday shave with a much easier routine.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s671",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Will I still need to use a razor after…",
            "text": "Will I still need to use a razor afterward?",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s676",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · For most everyday maintenance, the goa…",
            "text": "For most everyday maintenance, the goal is a clean, smooth-looking finish without needing a second shave afterward. Some guys still keep a razor for the occasional ultra-close, baby-smooth finish—but Freebird is designed to handle the regular shave on its own.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s679",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Will it work on my hair type?",
            "text": "Will it work on my hair type?",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s684",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Freebird is designed for a wide range …",
            "text": "Freebird is designed for a wide range of hair types, but results can vary based on thickness, curl pattern, growth direction, and how long your hair is. It works best on shorter growth, and the included Precision Clipper can knock down longer hair before you finish close with the FlexSeries®.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s687",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · What if I haven’t shaved in a few days…",
            "text": "What if I haven’t shaved in a few days?",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s692",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · If your hair is still short, you can u…",
            "text": "If your hair is still short, you can usually shave it directly with the FlexSeries®. If it’s gotten longer, trim first, then shave close. That gives the rotary heads a better starting point and helps prevent longer hairs from getting flattened or missed.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s695",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Will it cause razor burn, bumps, or ir…",
            "text": "Will it cause razor burn, bumps, or irritation?",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s700",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Every scalp is different. Freebird use…",
            "text": "Every scalp is different. Freebird uses guarded electric cutting heads instead of an exposed manual razor blade directly against your skin, and you can shave wet or dry depending on what feels best for you. If you’re irritation-prone, start with light pressure and avoid repeatedly going over the same area.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s742",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · SHOW MORE",
            "text": "SHOW MORE",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
